XB-Kidux-Ages: 4-8
Description: Kidux learning module: Hello, a first page to read
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is a first page to read, in the child's language, and a button to
 press: the smallest thing a child can open from their screen, and a way to
 see that learning modules work on this computer.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
